*.png
# …except the ones the README shows. Screenshots are ignored by default because they are
# usually debugging leftovers; these four are documentation and have to survive a clone.
!docs/images/*.png
# …and the app's own icons, which is a sharper version of the same mistake: index.html
# and the manifest have always pointed at these, they were never committed, and the SPA
# fallback answered every request for one with index.html and a 200 — so the favicon and
# the Home Screen icon were missing in production without anything looking broken.
!apps/web/public/**/*.png
